  "description": "How a Webority web head ships its bytes and answers: Brotli-first response compression, static files with the fleet cache policy (versioned assets a year, never immutable), the Cloudflare edge-cache header middleware, the fleet API contract (the failure body {code, message, traceId} for every error including the framework's own, the status and code table, X-Correlation-Id, idempotent POST and PATCH, the minimum app build gate), an honest /health endpoint with database and data-protection checks, the paged list contract, and a build-time analyzer that keeps hand-written error bodies out with a shrink-only ceiling.",
